+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+This project's current recorded decision is that plain HTTP is not permitted anywhere, including for internal hosts: an HTTPS-everywhere policy is enforced project-wide with no plaintext exception, so all network communication must use encrypted HTTPS regardless of environment or build variant.
